  "details": "I don't know if this is a bug that only effects desktop or not, but as a desktop user I've encountered this strange bug, and it's as blatant as the title says: Can't scroll down on the friends list. It's permanently fixed to the top. I can still expand/shrink the lists and scroll through them horizontally, but I can't scroll down my friends list so anything beyond group 1 is effectively null to me.\n\nThis bug is as of June 20th, 11:00 NT.",
